# HTML Rules

- Use regional comments:
    ```html
    <!-- #Region ------------------------------------------ -->
        <!-- Content (4-space indent) -->
    <!-- endregion ---------------------------------------- -->
    ```
- Only 4-space indent (no tabs)
- Head must include UTF-8, viewport, description, author, title, favicon (`data-asset-href`), css
- Use semantic elements: `<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<footer>`, etc.
- ARIA/accessibility required on buttons/nav/inputs
- IDs/classes: kebab-case, BEM for classes
- Script order: ModuleDependencyManager, ConfigManager, AppAssetsLoader, others, Main (last)
- Close all regions

NEVER:
- Use tabs
- Omit regions
- Use generic divs when semantic available
- Skip ARIA/alt text
- Use inline styles

